async function cleanup(){if(!owned)return;await c.rollback();for(const name of names){for(const t of ['PSMENUITEMLANG','PSMENUDEFNLANG','PSXFERITEM','PSMENUORIGIN','PSMENUITEM','PSMENUDEL','PSMENUDEFN'])await c.execute(`DELETE FROM ${t} WHERE MENUNAME=:n`,{n:name});for(const t of ['PSPCMTXT','PSPCMNAME','PSPCMPROG','PSPCMPROGDEL'])await c.execute(`DELETE FROM ${t} WHERE OBJECTID1=3 AND OBJECTVALUE1=:n`,{n:name});}for(const t of ['PSPROJECTITEM','PSPROJECTDEFN'])await c.execute(`DELETE FROM ${t} WHERE PROJECTNAME=:n`,{n:project});await c.commit();}
